      "profile": "<section class=\"margin-block pad-inline pad-block fill-shade border-radius\" aria-labelledby=\"github-connection-title\">\n  <h2 id=\"github-connection-title\" class=\"txt-large\">GitHub</h2>\n\n\n      <p>Connect GitHub to comment and review from PR threads as yourself. Linking also shows you cards for private repositories your account can read.</p>\n    <form class=\"flex align-center gap\" action=\"/github/connection\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\" method=\"post\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"authenticity_token\" value=\"post:/github/connection\" />\n      <input class=\"input flex-item-grow\" placeholder=\"github_pat_…\" autocomplete=\"off\" required=\"required\" aria-label=\"GitHub personal access token\" type=\"password\" name=\"access_token\" id=\"access_token\" />\n      <input type=\"submit\" name=\"commit\" value=\"Connect GitHub\" class=\"btn\" data-disable-with=\"Connect GitHub\" />\n</form>    <p class=\"txt-small\">The token needs <strong>Pull requests: Read and write</strong>, <strong>Issues: Read and write</strong>, and <strong>Metadata: Read</strong>. It is validated with GitHub before it is stored and is never shown again.</p>\n</section>\n",
